        "steps": [
          {
            "text": "Profile with django-debug-toolbar",
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Fix N+1 with annotate(Count)",
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Add composite index + migration",
            "done": true
          },
          {
            "text": "Cache page 1 in Redis (60s)",
            "done": true
          }
        ],
        "impact": "Cut load time from 9s to 1.4s (-84%). Support tickets about the slow dashboard stopped.",
        "challenges": "select_related made it worse at first: the real culprit was an N+1 in the serializer's task_count field.",
        "solution": "Annotated task_count with Count() in the queryset, added a composite index on (owner_id, updated_at), and cached the first page in Redis for 60s.",
